// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`moduleToText > accordion: text and markdown snapshots > markdown 1`] = `
"## Launch-week questions

Open the questions new account managers ask most.

### Who signs off a campaign before launch?

The account lead approves budget and targeting; the client approves creative. Both approvals are recorded in Orbit CRM before anything goes live.

### Can I change a live budget?

Yes, within ±20% per day without asking the client. Larger changes need a written OK:

- Note the reason in Orbit CRM
- Tell the client the same day
- Check pacing again after 24 hours

### What if tracking breaks?

Pause conversion-optimised campaigns first, then open a tracking ticket. Spend without tracking teaches the bidding algorithm the wrong lesson.

### When do clients get reports?

Every Monday by 10:00 local time. Northwind Outdoor also gets a short mid-week note during launches (illustrative schedule)."
`;

