- Search & social: High-intent search plus paid social. Converts best, but inventory caps out at 45%.

Explanation: Search & social converts best per dollar, but its curve flattens fast and inventory caps it at 45%. Premium CTV looks expensive at first, yet its response is almost a straight line, so it keeps earning while cheaper channels saturate. The optimal plan here puts 45% in search & social, 30% in CTV and 15% in programmatic, and keeps audio and out-of-home at token levels.  The rule of thumb: give the next dollar to whichever channel has the highest marginal return, not the best average.

Every plan trades reach for efficiency. Keep the marginal-return habit when you build the real Northwind flowchart."
