exports[`moduleToText > callout: text and markdown snapshots > markdown 1`] = `
"TIP: One naming rule for every campaign

Name campaigns **CLIENT · CAMPAIGN · CHANNEL · MARKET**, for example \`NWO · Spring Launch · Search · US\`.

Pulse Analytics groups reports by these four parts, so a missing part hides spend from the client dashboard."
`;

