exports[`moduleToText > carousel: text and markdown snapshots > markdown 1`] = `
"## Your first week

### Monday: meet the team

Shadow the Harbor Supply Co. account call and read the last three weekly reports.

### Tuesday: tools

Get access to Pulse Analytics and Orbit CRM. Build one dashboard view of your own.

### Wednesday: your first audit

Review one live campaign against the launch checklist and list what you would change.

### Friday: present

Walk your lead through the audit in ten minutes. **Two clear recommendations beat ten small ones.**"
`;

