exports[`moduleToText > screenshot-walkthrough: text and markdown snapshots > markdown 1`] = `
"## Find a client's last call note

Every account manager logs calls in Orbit CRM. Follow the steps to find what Maya from Northwind Bakery said on her last call.

1. Open your contacts: Click **Contacts** in the sidebar.
2. Search for the client: Type **Maya** into the search box and press Enter. (Search contacts, deals, tasks…) Type: Maya
3. Open the contact: Click the row for **Maya Lindqvist** to open her profile.
4. Go to the activity timeline: Switch to the **Activity** tab.
5. Review the last call note: Read the most recent **call note** at the top of the timeline. Maya wants the first creative concepts by next Thursday.

*[Image: Orbit CRM dashboard with the sidebar navigation on the left.]*

Note: The sidebar is the same on every page, so you can jump to Contacts from anywhere.

*[Image: Contacts list showing six people and a search box in the top bar.]*

Note: Search matches first names, last names and companies, so a first name is usually enough.

*[Image: Contacts list filtered to one result: Maya Lindqvist.]*

*[Image: Maya Lindqvist's profile with Overview, Activity and Deals tabs.]*

Note: Overview shows static details. Activity is where calls, emails and meetings are logged in order.

*[Image: Activity timeline with the most recent call note at the top.]*

Note: Call notes are what the creative team reads before a kickoff. Keep them short and concrete.

You can now find any client's latest conversation in under a minute. Next time, try the same path for **Tomas Herrera**."
`;

